313d7bbe","quote":"● an exemption from the rule that a majority of our board of directors must be independent directors;","context":"Under the Nasdaq Listing Rules, a company of which more than 50% of the voting power is held by an individual, group or another company is a “controlled company” and is permitted to elect to rely, and may rely, on certain exemptions from corporate governance rules, including:","section":"● actual or anticipated fluctuations in our quarterly results of operations and changes or revisions of our expected results;","block":434,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001731122-26-000158","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-01-30","reportDate":"2025-09-30","cik":"0001979610","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1979610/000173112226000158/e7256_20-f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/96222b68f8b625ae5316a38ab17b19a427a1f2bab8a3cba1e5f7ccfeaf73d0b3.bin","sha256":"96222b68f8b625ae5316a38ab17b19a427a1f2bab8a3cba1e5f7ccfeaf73d0b3"}},{"id":"8795c0be8200b472a47ecf81ff944e755f59cbab883e5d5e134218a10f54da9c","quote":"● an exemption from the rule that the compensation of our Chief Executive Officer must be determined or recommended solely by independent directors; and","context":"● an exemption from the rule that a majority of our board of directors must be independent directors;","section":"● actual or anticipated fluctuations in our quarterly results of operations and changes or revisions of our expected results;","block":435,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001731122-26-000158","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-01-30","reportDate":"2025-09-30","cik":"0001979610","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1979610/000173112226000158/e7256_20-f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/96222b68f8b625ae5316a38ab17b19a427a1f2bab8a3cba1e5f7ccfeaf73d0b3.bin","sha256":"96222b68f8b625ae5316a38ab17b19a427a1f